1
00:00:09,488 --> 00:00:18,944
I take the train to work each day,
And watch the morning turn to grey.

2
00:00:19,911 --> 00:00:29,222
I play 'One Year of Love' so clear,
To drown the pain that stays so near.

3
00:00:29,683 --> 00:00:39,625
I miss her smile, her dark brown eyes,
Her gentle voice, her quiet sighs.

4
00:00:40,167 --> 00:00:53,214
I miss her scent, her tender touch,
My God, I miss Luna so much!

5
00:01:01,721 --> 00:01:11,778
A tap upon my shoulder cold,
My breath freezes, my eyes behold.

6
00:01:12,165 --> 00:01:21,803
Her big dark eyes, so sweet to see,
She whispers "Hi", and smiles at me.

7
00:01:21,921 --> 00:01:32,239
I miss her smile, her dark brown eyes,
Her gentle voice, her quiet sighs.

8
00:01:32,373 --> 00:01:45,440
I miss her scent, her tender touch,
My God, I miss Luna so much!

9
00:01:54,535 --> 00:02:04,072
We sit together, thigh to thigh,
And watch the grey world hurry by.

10
00:02:04,892 --> 00:02:14,346
She holds my hand, no words we speak,
In quiet joy, so warm and meek.

11
00:02:14,816 --> 00:02:24,790
And every time she leaves the train,
To step into the morning rain,

12
00:02:25,097 --> 00:02:35,186
She holds my face and kisses me,
Upon my lips so tenderly.

13
00:02:35,662 --> 00:02:45,535
Until the Tuesday she was gone,
And I was left to carry on!

14
00:02:46,168 --> 00:02:55,673
I sit alone upon the train,
Where 'One Year of Love' remains in pain!

15
00:02:55,786 --> 00:03:06,040
Why did I stay upon my seat,
And watch her walk into the street?

16
00:03:06,267 --> 00:03:21,581
Why didn't I step out the door,
And go with her for evermore?

